<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="aHGY8" id="aHGY8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0823cddc" id="u0823cddc">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u214bfb63" id="u214bfb63"> 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u023b1f1b" id="u023b1f1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="udabb0f2f" id="udabb0f2f">大语言模型完全处于生成式建模的框架之内。大语言模型旨在通过最大似然估计来优化模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff6402fd50405c6ba587f0121eced42a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t9jeY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0062f9e5" id="u0062f9e5">，从而刻画真实但未知的语言分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab3a6b77c77b2931d7076b807bec6bc0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qu0tO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u695374f6" id="u695374f6">；等价地，这一过程也可以表述为最小化这两个分布之间的 KL 散度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc545375c" id="uc545375c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cmax_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5C%3B%5C%5CLongleftrightarrow%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BKL%7D%5C%5Cleft(p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%BC%8F%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%99%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd7e7b4492ee331f56e321871eb282fe6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZJtrz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u092e14b3"><li fid="ubbf37f1f" data-lake-id="uc957570b" id="uc957570b"><span data-lake-id="u7754302a" id="u7754302a">当前占主导地位的方法采用自回归建模，即通常所称的下一词元预测范式，来定义模型分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1c16c351" id="u1c16c351" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderbrace%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(x)%3Dp_%5C%5Ctheta(x%5E1)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D2%7D%5E%7BL%7Dp_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x%5E1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx%5E%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7B%E8%87%AA%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae1deed3e1d9fba046f3eadbdd924f8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oXln8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1fafecce"><li fid="u8b7bf6d7" data-lake-id="uc596f109" id="uc596f109"><span data-lake-id="u68f09d72" id="u68f09d72">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gvrIG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b5243fe" id="u3b5243fe">是长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gk2v3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e364ee7" id="u7e364ee7">的序列，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%5Ei%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9c5368836c68bf342e11085f05edd812.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rtRoR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb96b0a1" id="ucb96b0a1">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bLZi9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c07c376" id="u2c07c376">个词元。这一范式已被证明极为有效，并成为当前大语言模型的基础。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28014efc" id="u28014efc" style="color: #DF2A3F">然而，尽管它得到广泛应用，一个根本性问题仍未得到解答：自回归范式是否是实现大语言模型核心能力——例如可扩展性、上下文学习和指令遵循的唯一路径？</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a8ed329" id="u5a8ed329"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf297f79" id="ubf297f79">作者认为，此前被忽视的关键认识在于：从根本上支撑大语言模型基本特性的，是生成式建模原则，而不是自回归形式</span></strong></p><ul list="u91629bdd"><li fid="u674ccba6" data-lake-id="ue6c47396" id="ue6c47396"><span data-lake-id="udcf22293" id="udcf22293">可扩展性主要源于 Transformer、模型规模、数据规模，以及由生成式建模原则所带来的费舍尔一致性之间的相互作用，而并非自回归模型独有的结果</span></li><li fid="u674ccba6" data-lake-id="u4b5938eb" id="u4b5938eb"><span data-lake-id="u2395c6c4" id="u2395c6c4">扩散 Transformer 在视觉数据上的成功支持这一观点。在结构一致的语言任务上，指令遵循和上下文学习能力似乎是所有条件生成模型的内在属性，而非自回归模型独有的优势。尽管自回归模型可以被解释为一种无损数据压缩器，但任何具有足够表达能力的概率模型都可以实现类似的能力</span></li><li fid="u674ccba6" data-lake-id="udf5a4cc8" id="udf5a4cc8"><span data-lake-id="ubf2b5e12" id="ubf2b5e12">然而，大语言模型的某些固有限制，可以直接归因于其自回归性质。例如，从左到右的生成过程限制它们处理逆向推理任务的能力，这凸显当前模型在泛化能力方面的一种典型缺陷</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufbb5c122" id="ufbb5c122"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9cddd79" id="ua9cddd79">基于上述认识，提出 LLaDA，以探究大语言模型所展现的能力，能否从自回归模型之外的生成式建模原则中涌现，从而回答前述根本性问题</span></strong></p><ul list="ueccb8040"><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="u3f033c1c" id="u3f033c1c"><span data-lake-id="u6fd6507d" id="u6fd6507d">不同于传统自回归模型，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f422049" id="u8f422049" style="color: #5C0036">LLaDA 采用掩蔽扩散模型（Masked Diffusion Model，MDM），其中包含一个前向数据掩蔽过程，并通过训练掩蔽词元预测器来近似对应的逆向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908c4b92" id="u908c4b92">。这一设计使 LLaDA 能够构建具有双向依赖关系的模型分布，并优化其对数似然的变分下界，从而为理解上述大语言模型的核心能力，提供一个具有理论依据且此前尚未探索的视角</span></li><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="uf891dcba" id="uf891dcba"><span data-lake-id="ubcdaf99e" id="ubcdaf99e">采用包括数据准备、预训练、监督微调和评估在内的标准流程，将 LLaDA 扩展至语言扩散模型此前未达到的 8B 参数规模</span></li><li fid="ub2e65466" data-lake-id="u8d57615a" id="u8d57615a"><span data-lake-id="u04475aa4" id="u04475aa4">具体而言，LLaDA 8B 在 2.3 万亿个词元上从零开始预训练，消耗 13 万 H800 GPU 小时，随后使用 450 万对样本进行监督微调</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="Kq4IF" id="Kq4IF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u83f19278" id="u83f19278">📡 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐦𝐀𝐬𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub2bbd0e0" id="ub2bbd0e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="udc5b3e79" id="udc5b3e79">不同于自回归模型，LLaDA 通过一个前向过程和一个逆向过程来定义模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf7c49ce7ddf84c338b6d69bd9279190.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ulq9U%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a571ac9" id="u7a571ac9">。前向过程逐步、独立地掩蔽</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zOjdE%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c979c16" id="u1c979c16">中的词元，直至在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe85963025272e26b55faee81091bcf89.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vuDHR%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcdb497c" id="ufcdb497c">时整个序列完全被掩蔽。当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99b525a94a8046ccd761e5fa16870ef3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f4g8d%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u85fe2655" id="u85fe2655">时，序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mdOB3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4bf4e970" id="u4bf4e970">处于部分掩蔽状态，每个词元以概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vovAl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u73de5840" id="u73de5840">被掩蔽，或以概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221-t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faebf971a2f51ede4bf89026cb1f13df8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bsJBP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb0ce394" id="ucb0ce394">保持未掩蔽状态。逆向过程则随着</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MXXHU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa6e46ab" id="uaa6e46ab">从 1 变化至 0，通过迭代预测被掩蔽的词元来恢复数据分布</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8da465f0" id="u8da465f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791165251268-4f6feb91-7b01-452d-82c2-7134ae341c2c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u7f45e299-5670-4dd8-b0e0-58f31f37618%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u0b3b2e7c-e55c-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A876.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A348%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A235237%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1364%2C%22originHeight%22%3A542%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPLIEDINDEPENDENTLYTOALLTOKENSATTHESAMERATIOU01.(B)SFTONLYRESPONSETOKENSARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A1325%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OSIBLYMASKED.(C)SAMPLING.LLADASIMULATESADIFFUSIONPROCESSFROM%3D1(FULLYMASKED)TO%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A462%2C%22width%22%3A1323%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3D0(UNMASKED)PREDICTINGALLMASKSSIMULTANEOUSLYATEACHSTEPWTHHEXIBLEREMASKSTRATEGIES%22%2C%22x%22%3A22%2C%22y%22%3A498%2C%22width%22%3A1317%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGURE2%3AOVERVIEWOFLLADA.(A)PRE-TRAINING.LLADAISTRAINEDONTEXTWITHRANDOMMASKS%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A1327%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKALLTOKENSINDEPENDENTLY%22%2C%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A259%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKRATIOT~U(O%2C1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1272%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A164%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NON-MASKTOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A117%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKPREDICTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1030%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKPREDICTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A589%2C%22y%22%3A182%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3ARANDOMMASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A267%2C%22y%22%3A343%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESPONSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKPREDICTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A151%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22x%22%3A1095%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESPONSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1127%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REMASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROMPT%22%2C%22x%22%3A994%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASKTOKEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A103%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A257%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT%22%2C%22x%22%3A544%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REMASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A999%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1082%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C%22%2C%22x%22%3A902%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A469%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%22%2C%22x%22%3A1077%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1eeec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua923dd56%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u34d7180c" id="u34d7180c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u18926d75" id="u18926d75" style="color: #5C0036">LLaDA 的核心是一个掩蔽词元预测器，即参数化模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff4707d7027485ad9d429bbbc339efa9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22amIAd%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uff00344b" id="uff00344b" style="color: #5C0036">。它以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CinRP%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u684fd63e" id="u684fd63e" style="color: #5C0036">为输入，同时预测所有被掩蔽的词元，其中掩码词元记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F105fe022a307a9614dc3d2678893099c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iVgzQ%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u047e997d" id="u047e997d" style="color: #5C0036">。训练时，仅在被掩蔽的词元位置上计算交叉熵损失</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u28f787c7" id="u28f787c7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Ctriangleq-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cx_0%2Cx_t%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Bx_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(x_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01960762055df7a9c7d5b237a13201da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a1pwy%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u226afeb4"><li fid="u2f664368" data-lake-id="uda7207b1" id="uda7207b1"><span data-lake-id="ude408a06" id="ude408a06">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hJh8C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90f63063" id="u90f63063">为训练样本，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pnuq7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab98bc32" id="uab98bc32">为从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12d16d9672fe55e37279ae7043b605de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WTk9p%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76b23635" id="u76b23635">上均匀采样的连续随机变量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iLA5f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7c95d64" id="ua7c95d64">从前向过程中采样得到，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fmkg7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubba8ba1f" id="ubba8ba1f">为序列长度。指示函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F160423572f28714d0d8d11e99b9ed01e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wYjuL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue42464eb" id="ue42464eb">确保仅在被掩蔽的词元位置上计算损失</span></li><li fid="u2f664368" data-lake-id="u9749856b" id="u9749856b"><span data-lake-id="u016aa8cd" id="u016aa8cd">训练完成后，可以模拟由掩蔽词元预测器参数化的逆向过程，并将该过程在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf76c4580adc6af67436e1cd68eed17d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yFqcN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf74fe3fa" id="uf74fe3fa">时诱导的边缘分布定义为模型分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf7c49ce7ddf84c338b6d69bd9279190.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kuq3V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9db95054" id="u9db95054">。已有研究证明，式（3）中的损失函数是模型分布负对数似然的上界，因此，它为生成式建模提供具有理论依据的优化目标：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1487b286" id="u1487b286" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(x_0)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta).%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff4ee6f9569674cf72aeb8d4bdffdff2c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUfSi%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44aa1cf6"><li fid="u2c342b0e" data-lake-id="u70477181" id="u70477181"><span data-lake-id="ucc00ed7e" id="ucc00ed7e">LLaDA 使用在 0 到 1 之间随机变化的掩蔽比例，而 BERT 使用固定的掩蔽比例。这一细微差异具有重要影响，尤其是在大规模建模情形下：如式（4）所示，LLaDA 是一种具有理论依据的生成模型，具有像大语言模型一样自然进行上下文学习和指令遵循的潜力</span></li><li fid="u2c342b0e" data-lake-id="u91083c9e" id="u91083c9e"><span data-lake-id="u53b70094" id="u53b70094">生成式建模视角意味着它在大规模数据和模型下具有较强的可扩展性。正是最大似然估计的理论基础，促使将离散扩散模型扩展至大规模语言建模</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud49ea1e5" id="ud49ea1e5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua28078e9" id="ua28078e9">与现有大语言模型类似，LLaDA 使用 Transformer 作为掩蔽词元预测器。LLaDA 不使用因果注意力掩码，因为其建模形式允许模型在预测时访问完整输入</span></strong></p><ul list="u6c726ac4"><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u488c9a5d" id="u488c9a5d"><span data-lake-id="ua6b8901d" id="ua6b8901d">训练两种不同规模的 LLaDA，参数量分别为 1B 和 8B。由于 LLaDA 与 KV 缓存不兼容，为简化实现，使用标准多头注意力，而非分组查询注意力。这使得注意力层具有更多参数，因此，缩小前馈网络的维度，以保持相近的模型规模。由于采用针对所用数据进行适配的分词器，词表大小也有所不同</span></li><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u6f802693" id="u6f802693"><span data-lake-id="uc162903d" id="uc162903d">LLaDA 在包含 2.3 万亿个词元的数据集上进行预训练，数据处理流程与现有大语言模型高度一致，未引入任何特殊技术。数据来自在线语料，使用人工设计的规则和基于大语言模型的方法过滤低质量内容。除通用文本外，数据集还包含高质量的代码、数学和多语言数据。预训练采用固定的 4096 词元序列长度，总计算开销为 13 万 H800 GPU 小时，与相同模型规模和数据规模下的自回归模型相近</span></li><li fid="u2863e786" data-lake-id="u0407bc49" id="u0407bc49"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdd69e42" id="ucdd69e42" style="color: #664900">对于训练序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CSnRk%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfa6a9e2" id="ucfa6a9e2" style="color: #664900">，随机采样</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F85d2cfca61ca1cdb1fcd47ce76c4dc4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E54iW%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubabfbf66" id="ubabfbf66" style="color: #664900">，以相同的概率</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qYBs7%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ee7facb" id="u9ee7facb" style="color: #664900">独立掩蔽每个词元，得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22diCrP%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5ab747c" id="uc5ab747c" style="color: #664900">，并通过蒙特卡洛方法估计式（3），用于随机梯度下降训练。此外，遵循 Nie et al. 的方法，为增强 LLaDA 处理变长数据的能力，将 1% 的预训练数据设置为随机长度，该长度从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1%2C4096%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffc9fd5a7a0755c31b9f2d57f1564822.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sew4n%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8e9ba54" id="uc8e9ba54" style="color: #664900">范围内均匀采样</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3b0e659c" id="u3b0e659c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2130adba" id="u2130adba">使用成对数据</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(p_0%2Cr_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F926deedaa3cd1d4dca9da446dda865c9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TWYur%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua22e8697" id="ua22e8697">进行监督微调，以增强 LLaDA 的指令遵循能力，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bucse%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u07058e94" id="u07058e94">表示提示，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56e16f2584e7a47dd8a45a29067d0e0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KbXpM%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e92238e" id="u3e92238e">表示响应。该过程需要建模条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5C%5Cmid%20p_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58c88437fb4560e24c143e9d5195f5f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22scxpt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb51d8db" id="ueb51d8db">，而不是预训练阶段的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf7c49ce7ddf84c338b6d69bd9279190.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SozUL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3ca9c115"><li fid="ub6c92475" data-lake-id="u2cd7d411" id="u2cd7d411"><span data-lake-id="ua5462f4b" id="ua5462f4b">其实现方式与预训练类似。保持提示不变，并像处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kb0Tk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20178dee" id="u20178dee">一样，独立掩蔽响应中的词元。随后，将提示与掩蔽后的响应</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea05ff4255e7dbb1f9d66808e18da63f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KLsaQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1264db8a" id="u1264db8a">一并输入预训练的掩蔽词元预测器，计算 SFT 损失</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufc81227e" id="ufc81227e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2Cp_0%2Cr_0%2Cr_t%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bt%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br_t%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34401e89b2863f7f07fa34b7088e49f3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M3RS7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u67b5e689"><li fid="u9c77a37c" data-lake-id="ud94868bc" id="ud94868bc"><span data-lake-id="ubcd4d15f" id="ubcd4d15f">该方法与预训练完全兼容。本质上，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gcy3J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8366bfef" id="u8366bfef">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56e16f2584e7a47dd8a45a29067d0e0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U651R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6c17467" id="ud6c17467">的拼接可以视为未掩蔽的预训练数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d05334b5b0710d63edb6b4b3ac631c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRIC6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua468591b" id="ua468591b">，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gqGWg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb31b4e2" id="ucb31b4e2">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea05ff4255e7dbb1f9d66808e18da63f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sXDs3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04ea4725" id="u04ea4725">的拼接则对应掩蔽后的版本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21c4616d966dca0cdc4d982b04f94933.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o1Cye%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51a52689" id="u51a52689">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc976608f" id="uc976608f" style="color: #270070">这一过程与预训练相同，唯一的区别是所有被掩蔽的词元都位于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56e16f2584e7a47dd8a45a29067d0e0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MFPHE%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u75ce6603" id="u75ce6603" style="color: #270070">部分</span></strong></li><li fid="u9c77a37c" data-lake-id="ud9dce8a7" id="ud9dce8a7"><span data-lake-id="u2ba0e3b1" id="u2ba0e3b1">LLaDA 8B 在包含 450 万对样本的数据集上进行 SFT。与预训练过程一致，数据准备和训练均遵循现有大语言模型所采用的 SFT 流程，未引入任何额外技术来优化 LLaDA 的性能。该数据集覆盖代码、数学和指令遵循等多个领域。对于每个小批量中较短的样本对，在末尾追加</span><code data-lake-id="u2f61b7b4" id="u2f61b7b4"><span data-lake-id="u6999f286" id="u6999f286">|EOS|</span></code><span data-lake-id="u9c7e6dd7" id="u9c7e6dd7">词元，以确保所有样本长度一致。训练时，将</span><code data-lake-id="uce68a9fa" id="uce68a9fa"><span data-lake-id="u2f28c972" id="u2f28c972">|EOS|</span></code><span data-lake-id="u9a64bded" id="u9a64bded">视为普通词元；采样时则将其移除，从而使 LLaDA 能够自动控制响应长度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u374c78b0" id="u374c78b0"><strong><span data-lake-id="uae6190d8" id="uae6190d8">作为生成模型，LLaDA 能够以扩散方式采样生成新文本，并评估候选文本的似然，而不是采用从左到右的自回归方式</span></strong></p><ul list="ua6cf0b16"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="ufc64c549" id="ufc64c549"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf792627a" id="uf792627a">逆向生成过程：给定提示</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nlg8U%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub73ce9f4" id="ub73ce9f4">，从一个完全被掩蔽的响应开始，通过离散化逆向过程，从模型分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(r_0%5C%5Cmid%20p_0)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58c88437fb4560e24c143e9d5195f5f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S8ANP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bc0c5b2" id="u3bc0c5b2">中采样。总采样步数是一个超参数，这使 LLaDA 能够自然地在效率与样本质量之间进行权衡。默认情况下，采用均匀间隔的时间步。此外，生成长度也被视为一个超参数，用于指定采样过程开始时完全被掩蔽的序列长度。生成完成后，丢弃</span></strong><code data-lake-id="uab62d64f" id="uab62d64f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7916021" id="ua7916021">|EOS|</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id="u65cadb8a" id="u65cadb8a">词元之后的所有词元</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="ua6cf0b16" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u261478df" id="u261478df"><span data-lake-id="ubab1deff" id="ubab1deff">在从时间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9062d1349e81fd95a5670c53f1c06a5a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IDOAd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29f0fda7" id="u29f0fda7">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%5C%5Cin%5B0%2Ct)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8890e2bb4225790eb62fe9cd8386c7d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nDsij%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00b09b5a" id="u00b09b5a">的一个中间步骤中，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5940a3acff4f38f793a8ce19bdb8690.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IkBqq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e30ac81" id="u5e30ac81">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea05ff4255e7dbb1f9d66808e18da63f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qjE1H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94d954c7" id="u94d954c7">一并输入掩蔽词元预测器，同时预测所有被掩蔽的词元。随后，在期望意义上，将这些预测词元中比例为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bs%7D%7Bt%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e656cd6abc765c5fcdf06592b27127f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wvbUH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbb61c30" id="ucbb61c30">的部分重新掩蔽，得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F66129d44f00b51feb3db32eeb1a6bac9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zJgbk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97d13d4d" id="u97d13d4d">，从而确保逆向过程的转移与前向过程相匹配，以实现准确采样</span></li><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u2d7ce818" id="u2d7ce818"><span data-lake-id="u969bd68b" id="u969bd68b">原则上，重新掩蔽策略应当完全随机。然而，受大语言模型采样中退火技巧的启发，采用低置信度重新掩蔽策略：根据模型预测，将预测词元中置信度最低、占比为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bs%7D%7Bt%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2e656cd6abc765c5fcdf06592b27127f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HQicj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ce46a4b" id="u3ce46a4b">的部分重新掩蔽</span></li></ul><ul list="ua6cf0b16" start="2"><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="u71ed9e27" id="u71ed9e27"><span data-lake-id="u1c8e732a" id="u1c8e732a">LLaDA 支持灵活的采样方式。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u16cda6c5" id="u16cda6c5" style="color: #270070">具体而言，在完成上述预训练或 SFT 后，它可以直接支持自回归采样和块扩散采样，无需任何进一步的修改或训练。不过，扩散采样，即逆向生成过程，能够获得最佳性能，因此被作为本文的默认采样方式</span></strong></li><li fid="u041063c1" data-lake-id="uc7756ede" id="uc7756ede"><span data-lake-id="u8146400f" id="u8146400f">对于条件似然评估，可以自然地利用式（5）中的上界。然而下述等价形式具有更低的方差，且更加稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u17490968" id="u17490968" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bl%2Cr_0%2Cr_l%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7Bl%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Br_l%5Ei%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft(r_0%5Ei%5C%5Cmid%20p_0%2Cr_l%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff44eac71b3d9e39fef42ff512087cebf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mRPPU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uadb1ebbe" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ua9d39918" data-lake-id="ue17dccfc" id="ue17dccfc"><span data-lake-id="uad4cf4b3" id="uad4cf4b3">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Woldx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee52f6f0" id="uee52f6f0">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56e16f2584e7a47dd8a45a29067d0e0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PpuKz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cf10b30" id="u5cf10b30">的序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZfws%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue39a9096" id="ue39a9096">从集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B1%2C2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CL%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F966fe737133e23725d47d32c7ef7b94e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OK5zW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31d45e39" id="u31d45e39">中均匀采样；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22ed6ac6b67289ec9e1b5d2a8b8fa9fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Btvyf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u548dcda7" id="u548dcda7">则通过从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56e16f2584e7a47dd8a45a29067d0e0e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vdRGL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud117b670" id="ud117b670">中均匀、无放回地采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lm5s0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub13559f9" id="ub13559f9">个词元并将其掩蔽而得到</span></li></ul>